🔟 Scenario: Reprocessing old data

Question

Your analytics team wants to reprocess messages from the last 7 days. How can Kafka support this?

Answer

Kafka stores messages based on retention policy.

Example:

retention.ms = 7 days

Consumers can reset offset:

consumer.seek()

Or create a new consumer group to read from beginning.



